# Downloaded / large directories (populated by setup-extra.sh and download scripts).
# Also holds the vendor SDK/U-Boot/unbrick trees and the lomiyoo.com stock OTA
# packages (MIYOOOS/). Nothing here is published, so the wiki must never cite a
# path under Extra/ — readers cannot see it.
